  "description": "By day, Seo-Yun is the hardworking secretary to Taegwan Group’s somewhat arrogant, impossibly handsome Executive Director Ji-Hyeok Seo, who she happens to have a huge crush on. But after a drunken mishap and a colossal misunderstanding, her life is turned upside down. When Ji-Hyeok’s friend mistakes Seo-Yun for his girlfriend, his unexpected solution is a fake relationship bound by a strict contract including mandatory dates and public displays of affection. As fake dates lead to real kisses and unexpected sweetness, Seo-Yun begins to wonder just how fake this relationship actually is.\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
